      "routechangedlistener now fires after route generation after an alternative route is selected before navigation starts and after a route is cleared",
      "visual highlighting is added to destination buildings created with a place id to help users identify and navigate to the intended destination",
      "guidance notifications can be disabled and the app and background services can shut down when the user swipes away the app from recent tasks",
      "prominent landmark points of interest are shown by default along routes and near key intersections where maneuvers are required",
      "uses the current route context to hide low priority road labels that do not intersect the route during turn by turn navigation",
      "allows providing enhanced location context to the waypoint api using a place id and coordinates or a navigationpointtoken",
      "new apis let apps check whether incident reporting is available and open the incident reporting panel programmatically",
      "the map includes detailed road features such as crosswalks sidewalks and lane markings in select metropolitan areas",
      "references stop signs in navigation voice guidance when describing upcoming maneuvers in the us japan and sweden",
      "the default and high detail constants switch the app s default map view between simple and detailed styles",
      "the prompt visibility api helps avoid conflicts between sdk generated ui elements and custom ui elements",
      "the sdk can alert users about disruptions along their route and let them report and verify disruptions",
      "traffic light and stop sign icons can now appear along the route in additional supported countries"
